    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3097" root="بكى" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَكِىٌّ</span></b>  One <i>who weeps much;</i> (S, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَكَّآءٌ</span></b> . (K, but omitted in some copies and in the
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ عَيِيٌّ بَكِىٌّ</span>, <i>A man unable to speak.</i>
(Mbr, TA.) [But perhaps this should be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَكِىْءٌ</span>:
see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بكأ</span>.]

